text+='Validation: 5,900 current content values including 381 checkbox display keys, all 326 final changed values, and 1,544 fresh-generator content values pass the actual Markdown/MathJax renderer (309 initial final values plus 26 final guard values were rendered, with 9 overlap). All 18 blank questions mount original MathLive controls and fit 390px. The proposed records pass 4,034 native grading checks; 180 fresh generator records pass 1,108 checks. All 830 numeric matrix stages across 225 existing solutions and 306 stages across 68 fresh solutions pass row-equivalence checks. Source comparison verifies 656 given matrices across 265 questions; all 413 available source prompts have matching given-matrix collections, including 148 without matrices. Representative source/current/proposed screenshots under `screens/` were visually compared. Three retained pedagogical images were inspected directly and remain unchanged.\n\n'
text+='The q-42156 duplicate selection field is documented in `duplicate-history.json`. Independently solving x−2y=1 identifies original answer 17592186104028. All incoming references at T9047 were checked for the question, both fields and ten choices; none are learner task/response references. Keep the missing-key repair for the original field; root will separately detach its redundant question membership while retaining every entity and choice.\n\n'
